Diarization helper (native/akou-diarize)
----------------------------------------

NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Diarization (OpenMDW-1.1), https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Nemotron-3-Diarization
  The speaker model the helper runs, live and in the final pass. Not bundled: akou downloads the
  ONNX export (https://huggingface.co/altunenes/parakeet-rs, revision
  4d2a8bc71f5c896ec40faa59732e6716295edaf2, nemotron-3-diarization/nemotron3_diar_v3.onnx, whose
  folder carries the same OpenMDW-1.1 text) on first run, checked against its pinned SHA-256.
  OpenMDW-1.1 asks that a copy of the agreement travel with any redistribution of the model:
  https://openmdw.ai/license/1-1/

ONNX Runtime 1.28.0 (MIT), https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. Linked statically from the prebuilt library ort-sys
  downloads for each target (https://github.com/pykeio/ort). Its own third-party notices apply:
  https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/blob/v1.28.0/ThirdPartyNotices.txt

Oniguruma (BSD-2-Clause), https://github.com/kkos/oniguruma
  Copyright (c) 2002-2021 K.Kosako. Built from source and linked statically through onig_sys (MIT),
  for the tokenizer crate parakeet-rs depends on.

